{"id": "1807916", "name": "פולינום מקלורן וגבול – פונקציה מעריכית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "T", "params": ["k"], "body": "sum(subst(x=0,diff(f,x,j))*x^j/j!,j,0,k)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396484_LHOPITAL_MACLAURIN_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פולינום מקלורן וגבול – פונקציה מעריכית</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>נתונה הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<p>מצאו את פולינום מקלורן מסדר \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\)</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(\\displaystyle T_{ {{CT:1}} }\\left(x\\right)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>בעזרת הפולינום שמצאתם חשבו את הגבול</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}{{CT:2}}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>בדיקת ההקלדה</strong><br>[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: none; margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q3396484_LHOPITAL_MACLAURIN_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p>לפי נוסחת מקלורן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle T_m\\left(x\\right)=\\sum_{k=0}^{m}\\frac{f^{\\left(k\\right)}\\left(0\\right)}{k!}x^k\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן במקרה שלנו</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle T_{ {{CT:1}} }\\left(x\\right)={{CT:3}}\\)</div>\n<p>כדי לחשב את הגבול מספיק האיבר הראשון שאינו נמצא בפולינום מסדר נמוך יותר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=T_{ {{CT:4}} }\\left(x\\right)+\\frac{f^{\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}\\left(0\\right)}{{{CT:1}}!}x^{ {{CT:1}} }+o\\left(x^{ {{CT:1}} }\\right)\\)</div>\n<p>לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.95; white-space: normal;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{x\\to0}{{CT:2}}=\\frac{f^{\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)}\\left(0\\right)}{{{CT:1}}!}={{CT:5}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 42, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "a+b*x+c*x^2+d*x^3", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 22, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "T(m)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">פולינום מקלורן נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">בדקו את הנגזרות בנקודה אפס ואת הגורמים הפקטוריאליים.</p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "limit", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">השתמשו באיבר הראשון שאינו נכלל בפולינום מסדר נמוך יותר.</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "f", "g", "limit", "m"], "nvariants": 50}